  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "かたい　しっぽで　ちちゅう　ふかくのがんばんを　くりぬき　すを　つくる。すあなは　ながさ１０キロに　およぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "단단한 꼬리로 땅속 깊은 곳에 있는 암반을 뚫어서 보금자리를 만든다. 굴의 깊이는 무려 10km에 이른다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用堅硬的尾巴挖穿地下深處的岩盤來築巢。巢穴可以長達１０公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se sert de sa queue pour creuser son terrier dans les profondeurs rocheuses de la terre. Celui-ci peut faire jusqu’à 10 km de long.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mit seinem harten Schweif höhlt es tief unter der Erde Felsgestein aus, um seinen Bau zu graben. Dessen Gänge können bis zu 10 km lang werden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa su dura cola para horadar el lecho rocoso en las profundidades de la tierra y establecer su madriguera, cuyos túneles se extienden 10 km.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Con la dura coda perfora gli strati rocciosi del sottosuolo per farne la sua tana, che può raggiungere i 10 km di profondità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon uses its hard tail to make its nest by boring holes into bedrock deep underground. The nest can reach lengths of over six miles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "硬い　尻尾で　地中　深くの岩盤を　くり抜き　巣を　作る。巣穴は　長さ１０キロに　およぶ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用坚硬的尾巴来挖穿地下深处的岩盘来筑巢。巢穴长达１０公里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa su dura cola para horadar el lecho rocoso en las profundidades de la tierra y establecer su madriguera, cuyos túneles se extienden 10 km.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ほそながい　はいいっぱいに　くうきをすいこみ　きょうれつな　ばくふうを　おこしててきを　すから　おいだす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "가늘고 긴 폐 안에 공기를 가득 채운 뒤 강렬한 폭풍을 일으켜서 상대를 굴에서 쫓아낸다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會吸進空氣充滿細長的肺部，然後掀起強烈的爆炸氣浪將敵人趕出自己的巢穴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il chasse ses adversaires de son nid avec de violentes bourrasques qu’il génère en expirant l’air accumulé dans ses poumons longs et fins.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es vertreibt Feinde aus seinem Nest, indem es große Mengen Luft in seine lange, schmale Lunge saugt und eine mächtige Druckwelle ausstößt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Para expulsar a los intrusos de su madriguera, infla sus largos y finos pulmones y luego libera el aire de golpe en una intensa y explosiva ráfaga.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Scaccia i nemici che si intrufolano nella sua tana con violente raffiche di vento che emette dai lunghi polmoni dopo averli riempiti d’aria.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It drives enemies out of its nest by sucking in enough air to fill its long, narrow lungs, then releasing the air in an intense blast.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "細長い　肺いっぱいに　空気を吸い込み　強烈な　爆風を　起こして敵を　巣から　追い出す。",
      "language": {
